              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eeharusmoodá' an kwí tí gaa lamabu'un, nee an kwí tí gaa gooin. Nee atén a xuaán adór lamabu'uungós tar oo ló'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
